From 0d93dac1005e9c272e3c667f4f89dabd52c9366c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wzhao18 <wzhao18.sz@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 14:15:14 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Align Mamba prefix-cache checkpoints with the Eagle replay
 boundary

Squashes the prefix-replay-checkpoints work:
- make sure Mamba cache states land where the eagle drop block can work
- always rewind one block for the prompt boundary
- derive the replay boundary globally
- fix mooncake

Signed-off-by: wzhao18 <wzhao18.sz@gmail.com>
